00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:42.020
99% would accept the Matrix, living in the virtual world.

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.400
The remaining 1% would choose the other option,

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:49.000
becoming a free mind, destined to become part of the human resistance basin in the in Zion.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:51.000
In his speech, he says this,

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.540
"You are the eventuality of an anomaly,

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.180
which despite my sincerest efforts,

00:02:55.180 --> 00:03:01.160
I have been unable to eliminate from what is otherwise a harmony of mathematical precision."

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:06.280
But if the one is truly the only imperfection in a mathematically perfect system,

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:09.740
that would mean he's already found a solution for human free will,

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:13.960
for the remaining 1% of people who refuse to accept the Matrix,

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.540
and what was that solution?

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.540
Well, he did it by offering them a choice,

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:21.740
The option of Zion, the "real world,"

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.860
a simulated quest to escape being enslaved by the machines.

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:30.000
He's already admitted to creating imperfect worlds for humans to accept the Matrix.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:33.560
Is it really so hard to believe that he would create a simulated struggle

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:38.300
as another tier within the Matrix to account for those humans that reject a digital world?

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.300
It may seem like overthinking at first,

00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:44.480
but it actually explains a lot of logical errors from the franchise.

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.280
First off, let's look at the hilariously convoluted plot of the machines.

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:50.120
Futurama nailed this one on the head.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:54.140
(Leela' voice) "Don't be ridiculous, their bodies are being used to generate electricity.

00:03:54.140 --> 00:03:57.240
The idea came from and old movie called The Matrix,

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.140
(Bender's voice) but ... but wouldn't almost anything make a better battery than a human body?

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.060
Like a potato? Or a battery?"

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:07.680
So we're supposed to believe that the machines keep growing and harvesting humans

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.780
for use as makeshift batteries powering their vast artificial empire,

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:15.100
but the sad truth is, that just doesn't stack up with science.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:19.180
The amount of energy produced by literally billions of humans would be pocket change

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:22.100
compared to other sources of power available to the machines,

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.580
wind, geothermal, really anything.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.340
(Fry's voice) "Plus no matter how much energy

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:30.340
they produced, it would take more energy than that to keep them alive!"

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:33.480
It makes much more sense to use this setup of humans they got going

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:37.840
as something like a neural network for extra processing or computing power,

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.840
which, as it turns out fun fact,

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.840
was actually the Wachowskis' original idea.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.020
The suits at Warner Brothers thought that the human network concept

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:49.000
would be too confusing to an audience who had only recently been exposed to computers

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:49.940
at a massive scale,

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:53.660
and as a result forced the Wachowskis to change it in the last minute.

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.880
What we as audiences were left with was a huge scientific hole,

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.200
or a really compelling scenario

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:04.500
to keep the people who reject the Matrix occupied, freeing their fellow pod people.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.220
Speaking of the people who reject the Matrix,

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:11.060
we learn from the Architect that the 5 predecessors to Neo have supposedly freed a new set of humans,

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.060
and led to the creation of a new Zion

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.580
under the supervision of the machines.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.300
"After which you will be required to select from the Matrix

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:22.140
23 individuals, 16 female, 7 male to rebuild Zion."

